# Content packs (All-In-One)

Uni+ Learning Tools reads **only** `content-packs/` through content-api. A pack appears when this file exists:

`content-packs/<pack-folder>/manifest.json`

Do **not** nest packs in `S3/` or any year folder. Do **not** add teaching files under `public/`, `dist/`, `js/`, or `index.html` (old hub).

## Folder shape (one textbook chapter = one pack)

```
content-packs/ch1-planet-earth/
  manifest.json
  notes/*.pdf
  tools/<slug>/index.html
  summaries/
```

Chapters run from `ch1-planet-earth` through `ch15-analytical-chemistry`. Keep each textbook chapter as one pack.

## New chapter

1. Copy an existing pack folder. Rename it (`ch16-…`).
2. In `manifest.json`: `subject` `"CHEM"`, unique lowercase `scope`, `chapterCode`, `published: true`.
3. List every note, tool, quiz, summary, and flashcard page. Unlisted files are invisible.

## New item inside a chapter

Add `notes[]` with `topicCode` and one English PDF (`files.en` only). Add labs, games, quizzes, and flashcard pages under `tools/<slug>/` with `index.html`, and list them in `tools`. Set `"section": "games"` or `"section": "quizzes"` when the page is not a lab. Tag items with a syllabus **Symbol** from `content/topics/chem-topics.json` (`Earth1`, `MWI1A`, `Metal2`). Do not invent Symbols.

## Quizzes

Quiz pages are HTML under `tools/<slug>/index.html` with `"section": "quizzes"`. Keep old question ids. Leave quiz runners, `postMessage`, and tracking unchanged.

## HTML to keep

`content-packs/<pack>/tools/<slug>/index.html` (and its JS/CSS) — All-In-One embeds this.

## Stop

Duplicate `scope`, year-folder wrappers, or quiz runner / tracking changes → ask the technical owner. Do not push.
